<BaseLayout title="Home">

  <div>
    <h3>About Me</h3>
    <p>
    Hello! My name is AJ, I am a UX Researcher and Data Scientist.
    Currently, I am finishing up my undergrad degree in <a>Cognitive Systems</a> at the <a>University of British Columbia</a> where I have
    developed strong foundations in Philosophy, Statistics, and Computer Science.
    I have been fortunate to work on diverse teams, including startups, NGOs, research labs, and multinational corporations.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>Work</h3>
    <p>
    Right now, I also work part-time as a UX Researcher at <a>Global Relay</a>, where I apply computational techniques to study 
    user behavior at scale, better informing critical product and design decisions. 
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h3>Interests</h3>
    <p>
    Outside of work and studies, I am broadly interested in the Philosophies of Mind & Aesthetics, Symbolic Systems
    (Language, Logic, etc.), and Machine Learning. In my spare time, I also enjoy cooking and bouldering.
  </div>


